title: Each choice made for him, with the other way, is in the note of choices.
pid: 4c64d6dd-b7f1-4a57-8d8c-0f13486e222f
body: |2-
  [[id:41d36710-9473-4b9e-b7aa-648c5cd8f7c9][the hide report as built: each choice, why, and which were Jeff's]].
  The ones he is likeliest to answer: one "Hides nothing:" line per
  child, with its rule, rather than a bare "Hides nothing."; titles
  without IDs; the lines worded once, by the server; the echo area
  rather than a buffer.
